      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سجّنهُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَسْجِينٌ</span>, <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَقَّقَهُ</span> [<i>He cut it,</i>
or <i>divided it, lengthwise; clave it; split it;</i> &amp;c.].
(K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سجّن النَّخْلَ</span> <i>He made the palmtrees to be such as are termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِلْتِين</span> [or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِجِّين</span>;
i. e. <i>he dug at their feet trenches to conduct the
water to them when it did not reach to them</i>]. (K.)

